    relations #strong[after] this ṭawāf], [#strong[No additional
    penalty] --- the ṭawāf, though defective, lifted the restrictions],
    [Had physical relations #strong[before] Tawaf al-Ziyarah but
    #strong[after] Wuqūf ʿArafah], [#strong[Badanah] is wājib --- the
    second farḍ (ṭawāf) was not yet performed],
  )]
  , kind: table
  )

=== Two cases where badanah is wājib in Hajj
<two-cases-where-badanah-is-wajib-in-hajj>
+ #strong[Performing Tawaf al-Ziyarah in the state of janābah] --- and
  returning home without repeating it.
+ #strong[Physical relations after Wuqūf ʿArafah but before Tawaf
  al-Ziyarah] --- because the second farḍ has not yet been completed,
  and the full iḥrām restriction on relations is still in force.

#strong[Contrast:] If the person has performed the ṭawāf (even
defectively) and has done #strong[ḥalq/qaṣr] and #strong[naḥr], but only
#strong[ḥalq] was missing before the physical act, then the violation is
lesser --- only a #strong[shāt (goat)] is required, because the
remaining obligation (ḥalq) is lighter.

