== Part 7 --- Excursus: Classification of Khabar (Ḥadīth reports)
<part-7-excursus-classification-of-khabar-hadith-reports>
The teacher explained the foundational Ḥanafī uṣūl principle behind the
recurring difference with the Shāfiʿī school regarding #strong[farḍ vs
wājib].

=== Two parameters of ḥadīth authentication
<two-parameters-of-hadith-authentication>
+ #strong[How the ḥadīth reached us] --- the number and era of
  narrators.
+ #strong[What the ḥadīth refers to] --- its content and meaning.

=== Three categories of khabar
<three-categories-of-khabar>
#figure(
  align(center)[#table(
    columns: (19.61%, 21.57%, 25.49%, 33.33%),
    align: (auto,auto,auto,auto,),
    table.header([Category], [Definition], [Era of fame], [Ruling
